# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (and apps/api/Dockerfile with the legacy builder; BuildKit
# uses apps/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead). Dependencies and builds are produced inside the images.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
# production secrets and database dumps must never enter an image or the build cache
deploy
.git
